  "reviews": [
    {
      "product_id": "0d1aed05-cbae-5284-a116-a55334331097",
      "body_text": "I've carried this through four countries and it still looks new. The strap is the reason I bought it: one pull and the bag swings to the front, and the magnetic latch has never once opened on its own in a crowd. It takes a mirrorless body with a 35mm, a spare battery and a phone, and nothing more, which is the point.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-10T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-10T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "16b450ba-7ddf-5115-ab37-e54d87235bb4",
      "body_text": "Small enough that I actually bring it. I shoot it with one 35mm lens most days, and the battery gets me through a full day of walking around. The flip screen is the part I didn't know I needed.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-12T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-12T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "e2a3d98b-5847-589a-add1-a151cb7df8c2",
      "body_text": "Two batteries and a card wallet in one zip. Dull, but it ended the ritual of emptying the whole bag on a café table to find a card.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-02T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-02T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "bb9a46fe-0d8c-519f-afec-d22055806526",
      "body_text": "Every shoot gets a page: the brief, the shot list, the invoice. I tried three other tools and came back each time, mostly because clients can open a page without making an account.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-20T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-20T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "ad40b05d-0794-579b-a48c-2bc4fc091af6",
      "body_text": "It lights the desk and not the screen, so I can edit at night without a lamp reflecting in the photo I'm grading. I forget it's there, which is the best thing I can say about a lamp.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-15T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-15T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "70c1569d-e378-5ae9-ae7d-cddf361a101a",
      "body_text": "The camera goes in here the moment a boat is involved. Roll it three times and it floats; I tested that by accident off Nusa Penida.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-20T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-20T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "22c92968-e99b-5fd0-a2e6-19efd0e617b3",
      "body_text": "Doesn't run into my eyes when I sweat, which rules out most of the others I tried. One tube lasts me about a month of shooting outside.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-22T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "86badf18-ff3b-55b5-ad3f-b7bc101872a2",
      "body_text": "Forty seconds of grinding and the kitchen smells right. I bought it for travel and it never left the house.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-10T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-10T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "03d769b9-8c89-5438-a54a-5837348bc5da",
      "body_text": "It doesn't bounce, even full. I've washed it more times than I can count and the mesh hasn't stretched.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-18T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-18T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "d983f032-7601-545c-a709-869eb96f07de",
      "body_text": "Shrinks as you drink, so nothing sloshes. Buy two; you will lose a cap.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-18T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-18T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "4b88cd29-548c-541e-a515-7282be8df7f8",
      "body_text": "For the 5am starts. Bright enough to see roots, light enough that I forget I'm wearing it by the second kilometre.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-10-05T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-05T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "8b6ffa42-83ed-533a-a661-c7848450eca3",
      "body_text": "Three loops, and I use one of them for nearly everything. They hold an edge far longer than the set I learned on.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-08T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-08T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "b5a4b688-52fe-5240-a97f-8aeb0b69c3ab",
      "body_text": "Covers both knees at the wheel. It took me two years of ruined trousers to buy one.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-08T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-08T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "d1e54113-f57f-5668-a9e8-121fb4ed620d",
      "body_text": "Long enough to cover my knees while riding, and the hood fits under a helmet. It lives under the seat from November to March.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-25T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-25T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "5e00bd05-574e-5c18-ac3a-da5623ab7ee8",
      "body_text": "Hasn't dropped the phone once, including on the road to Kintamani, which drops everything.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-08-25T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-25T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "5b27facc-02e3-5936-a3f9-dc32f08afae0",
      "body_text": "Used it four times this year. Ten minutes by the roadside and I'm moving again, without pushing the bike to a workshop.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-30T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T03:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "ae0b3861-f8cf-587b-ad22-8a4cdd61cf79",
      "body_text": "Coffee from home is still hot at the top of the pass. It fits the hook under the handlebars, which is the only reason I chose this size.",
      "tidied": false,
      "published_at": "2026-09-16T03:00:00+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-16T03:00:00+00:00"
    }
  ],
